WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.512
Wide reading grows vocabulary; rereading and noting unfamiliar words helps retention.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:10.356
Which word best describes someone who helps others? Answer: helpful

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.040
Read a short passage and record four new words with guessed meanings.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:18.555
Discuss why: Helpful means ready to assist.
